# Prometheus Server Configuration
# This template configures the Prometheus server binary arguments.
# It is designed to be self-documenting and safe for reuse in Ansible roles.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Command-line arguments to pass to the Prometheus server binary.
# Schema default: '' (empty string)
# Description: Command-line arguments to pass to the Prometheus server binary.
#              Must be a single shell-escaped string.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: If you need to pass complex arguments involving quotes or special
# characters, ensure they are properly escaped for the shell before passing
# them via this variable.
ARGS="{{ (args | default('')) | string | trim }}"